OL,3,GNEWSAMajor plan to shape city's
OL,4,Adevelopment approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major plan which will shape future
OL,7,Fdevelopment in Peterborough has taken a
OL,8,Fbig step forward.
OL,10,FPeterborough City Council's cabinet met
OL,11,Fon Tuesday and were asked to approve
OL,12,Fthe final draft of the Local Plan,
OL,13,Fwhich is titled the Proposed
OL,14,FSubmission.
OL,16,FThe Local Plan is the key document
OL,17,Fwhich allows local authorities to guide
OL,18,Fdevelopment in their areas, with about
OL,19,F20,000 new homes and 196 hectares of
OL,20,Fnew employment land planned for the
OL,21,Fdistrict in the next 20 years.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
