OL,3,GNEWSAMajor plan to shape city's
OL,4,Adevelopment approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the meeting, members decided to
OL,7,Fapprove the Proposed Submission and
OL,8,Fenable a six-week consultation to take
OL,9,Fplace in September and October, before
OL,10,Fit is submitted to the government for
OL,11,Ffinal approval.
